  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "05. Attack Sequence",
    "ruleNumber": "05.02",
    "order": 94,
    "anchor": "05.02",
    "summary": "Roll 1 D6 **wound roll** per hit; the first case that matches applies:\n\n- an unmodified 1 fails\n- an unmodified 6 is a **critical wound**\n- a roll at or above the required number wounds\n- anything else fails\n\nThe required number compares the attack's Strength with the target's Toughness:\n\n- 2+ if Strength is at least twice Toughness\n- 3+ if Strength is higher\n- 4+ if they are equal\n- 5+ if Strength is lower\n- 6+ if Strength is at most half Toughness",
    "citations": [
      {
